{"id":39424,"date":"2025-01-02T23:59:34","date_gmt":"2025-01-02T22:59:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=39424"},"modified":"2026-08-21T00:02:43","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T23:02:43","slug":"trail-terras-de-oia-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-terras-de-oia-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Terras de Oi\u00e3 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"pr-expired-notice\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<\/span><div><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\">Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 decorreu.<\/strong><p style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #CBD5E1; margin: 2px 0 0 0;\">Consulta os resultados desta prova abaixo ou acede a todos os detalhes da edi\u00e7\u00e3o atual.<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-terras-de-oia\/\" style=\"background: #8B5CF6 !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 13.5px !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 11px 22px !important; border-radius: 10px !important; white-space: nowrap !important; display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important; height: 42px !important; margin: 0 !important; border: none !important; line-height: 1 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4) !important;\">Ver Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Atual &rarr;<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Esta prova decorrer\u00e1 em trilhos e estradas florestais na Freguesia de Oi\u00e3, com uma consider\u00e1vel \u00e1rea florestal com vista privilegiada sobre v\u00e1rios afluentes do Rio Levira e Rio C\u00e9rtima, com passagem pelo Parque da Fonte Doce, Parque da Seara, com trilhos completamente novos e renovados.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Com partida e chegada no novo parque da Vila, junto a Junta de Freguesia de Oi\u00e3 e com almo\u00e7o de confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o: Camisola T\u00e9cnica, Saco, Dorsal, Chip, Seguro Desportivo, Massagens, Abastecimentos, Banhos e Outros brindes que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o consiga arranjar.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o deste evento est\u00e1 a cargo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem Oianense juntamente com os Oi\u00e3Runners, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Oliveira do Bairro, da Junta de Freguesia de Oi\u00e3, do IPDJ e Regi\u00e3o de Aveiro<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O Trail &#8211; Terras de Oi\u00e3 2025 ser\u00e1 constitu\u00eddo por duas provas competitivas: Trail Longo &#8211; 24 (km)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Trail Curto &#8211; 16 (km)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kids Trail &#8211; 1 (km)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Caminhada (8Km)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":39425,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[34,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-39424","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-oia-oliveira-do-bairro","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte"],"acf":[]